SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - CREAZIONE ORDINE

1. INIZIALIZZAZIONE
   Cameriere → WaiterController: handleNewOrder()
   WaiterController → SceneManager: showTakeOrder(numeroTavolo)
   SceneManager → ViewFactory: forTakeOrder(numeroTavolo)
   ViewFactory → TakeOrderView: create()
   
   [CARICAMENTO ASINCRONO PRODOTTI]
   TakeOrderController → ProductLoadingService: new()
   ProductLoadingService → MenuUseCase: loadAllProducts()
   MenuUseCase → MenuService: loadAllProducts()
   MenuService → DatabaseService: getAllProducts()
   DatabaseService → PostgreSQL: SELECT menu_items
   [RITORNO DATI...]

2. SELEZIONE PRODOTTI
   [LOOP per ogni interazione]
   Cameriere → TakeOrderController: click prodotto
   TakeOrderController → [CALCOLO ASINCRONO]: update cart
   TakeOrderController → [ANIMAZIONE]: update UI

3. REVISIONE ORDINE
   Cameriere → TakeOrderController: handleSend()
   TakeOrderController → OrderReviewDialog: show()
   OrderReviewDialog → [CARICAMENTO ASINCRONO]: dettagli ordine
   Cameriere → OrderReviewDialog: conferma

4. CREAZIONE DATABASE
   TakeOrderController → UserSession: getInstance()
   TakeOrderController → UsersFactory: createUser()
   TakeOrderController → OrderUseCase: createOrder()
   
   [TRANSAZIONE DATABASE]
   OrderService → DatabaseService: createOrder()
   DatabaseService → OrderDAO: createOrder()
   OrderDAO → OrderDAOPostgres: createOrder()
   OrderDAOPostgres → PostgreSQL: BEGIN TRANSACTION
   [INSERT orders + order_items]
   OrderDAOPostgres → PostgreSQL: COMMIT

5. CONFERMA E PULIZIA
   TakeOrderController → [ANIMAZIONE]: successo
   TakeOrderController → SceneManager: showWaiter()
   [NOTIFICA ASINCRONA]: notifyKitchen()